# Galactic Anarchy music. Compiled by tools/GaTool (Music.cs).
# Lines starting with # are comments; elsewhere # is a sharp.
#
#   track NAME [once]        a new track; "once" plays it a single time, else it loops
#   v1 WAVE AD SR PW         voice 1's sound: WAVE tri/saw/pulse/noise, attack-decay and
#   v2 ...                   sustain-release as two hex digits each, pulse width (hex)
#   NOTE/FRAMES ...          after a voice line: its notes, e.g. A4/12 (octave 0-7, # for
#                            sharp), R/FRAMES for a rest; | is only for reading
# Every voice of a track must add up to the same length. 50 frames are a second (PAL).

